6dc:T6a2,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is the best Text to Image AI model on AA-Image-T2I v2.1?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst (max) currently leads AA-Image-T2I v2.1 with an Elo score of 1217."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the top models on AA-Image-T2I v2.1?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The top models on AA-Image-T2I v2.1 by Elo rating are: 1. GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst (max) (Elo 1217), 2. GPT Image 2.5 Flare (max) (Elo 1209), 3. GPT Image 2 (high) (Elo 1188), 4. Nano Banana 2.1 (Elo 1173), and 5. Grok Imagine Image 2.0 (Elo 1167). Rankings are based on blind votes from our validated private evaluators."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are Text to Image models ranked on this leaderboard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Models are ranked using an Elo rating system derived from blind comparisons judged by our validated private evaluators. Voters compare two images generated from the same prompt without knowing which model created each image. Higher Elo scores indicate a model is preferred more often."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Elo score does GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst (max) have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst (max) has an Elo score of 1217 across 12,743 comparisons on AA-Image-T2I v2.1."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is the best open weights model on AA-Image-T2I v2.1?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Qwen-Image-2.1 currently leads among open weights models on AA-Image-T2I v2.1 with an Elo score of 1042, followed by Ideogram 4.0 (Quality) (Elo 1023) and Ideogram 4.0 (Elo 1002)."}}]}6d7:["$","div",null,{"className":"w-full mb-12","children":[["$","$L6d8",null,{"type":"multiple","className":"w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto","children":[["$","$L6d9","Which is the best Text to Image AI model on AA-Image-T2I v2.1?-0",{"value":"item-0","children":[["$","$L6da",null,{"className":"tex